,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40240821,"data":"## 3. Literature Confound Analysis (GenImage Benchmarks)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40241124,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40241406,"data":"### 3.1 Spatial Resolution Disparity\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40241708,"data":"Detectors risk learning spatial resolution shortcuts if synthetic images have fixed dimensions (e.g. 512x512) while authentic images vary widely.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40242037,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.4024232,"data":"| Class | Count | Width Mean ± Std | Width Median | Height Mean ± Std | Height Median |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40242641,"data":"| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40242979,"data":"| **Real (Authentic)** | 5500 | 483.99 ± 191.59 | 500.0 px | 421.44 ± 163.21 | 375.0 px |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40243284,"data":"| **Fake (Synthetic)** | 5500 | 453.82 ± 227.45 | 512.0 px | 453.82 ± 227.45 | 512.0 px |\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40243602,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":109.40243889,"data":"### 3.2 JPEG Compression Quality ($Q \\in [1, 100]$ via DQT Inversion)\n"}
